[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/comments/166544397","html_url":"https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/1008#issuecomment-166544397","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/1008","id":166544397,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2NjU0NDM5Nw==","user":{"login":"gentledepp","id":1175751,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzU3NTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1175751?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp","html_url":"https://github.com/gentledepp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-12-22T07:48:18Z","updated_at":"2015-12-22T07:48:18Z","body":"I debugged this.\n\nThe resulting expression is:\n\n<pre>\n.Call System.Linq.Queryable.Where(\n    .Call System.Linq.Queryable.OrderBy(\n        .Constant<System.Linq.EnumerableQuery`1[AutoMapperSamples.EF.Dtos.OrderDto]>(AutoMapperSamples.EF.Dtos.OrderDto[]),\n        '(.Lambda #Lambda1<System.Func`2[AutoMapperSamples.EF.Dtos.OrderDto,System.Double]>)),\n    '(.Lambda #Lambda2<System.Func`2[AutoMapperSamples.EF.Dtos.OrderDto,System.Boolean]>))\n.Lambda #Lambda1<System.Func`2[AutoMapperSamples.EF.Dtos.OrderDto,System.Double]>(AutoMapperSamples.EF.Dtos.OrderDto $o) {\n    $o.Price\n}\n.Lambda #Lambda2<System.Func`2[AutoMapperSamples.EF.Dtos.OrderDto,System.Boolean]>(AutoMapperSamples.EF.Dtos.OrderDto $$it)\n{\n    $$it.OrderDate > (System.Nullable`1[System.DateTime]).Constant<System.Web.Http.OData.Query.Expressions.LinqParameterContainer+TypedLinqParameterContainer`1[System.DateTime]>(System.Web.Http.OData.Query.Expressions.LinqParameterContainer+TypedLinqParameterContainer`1[System.DateTime]).TypedProperty ==\n    .Constant<System.Nullable`1[System.Boolean]>(True)\n}\n</pre>\n\nBecause of the \"TypedLinqParameterContainer\", AutoMapper sees that both parameters are nullable and therefore calls\n\n<pre>\nprivate static void UpdateToNonNullableExpression(Expression right, out Expression newRight){\n    \n                if (right is ConstantExpression)\n                    newRight = Expression.Constant((right as ConstantExpression).Value,\n                        typeof(Nullable<>).MakeGenericType(right.Type));\n}\n</pre>\n\n... and here it tries to replace the ConstantExpression.\nBut as right.Type is of type \"Nullable<boolean>\", it cannot create a generic type as it would result in\nNullable<Nullable<boolean>> which is not supported.\n\nI fixed it, reproduced it with a test (ODataQueryTests.CanFilter_OrderDateGT()) \nand added a checkin in PR #997\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/comments/166544397/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gentledepp","id":1175751,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzU3NTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1175751?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp","html_url":"https://github.com/gentledepp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gentledepp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.